Hey Slayers, it&rsquo;s time for the June Neowsletter! In this issue we&rsquo;re covering a couple of big roadmap items we&rsquo;ve checked off our list as of yesterday&rsquo;s main branch patch and answering some of your recent questions. Let&rsquo;s dive in&hellip;
Dev Update The first feature we want to highlight is the Bestiary.
